      <p class="eyebrow">Show Pay GUIDE</p>
      <h1>Website terms</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 12 October 2026</p>
      <p>app-showpay.in is an independent promotional and information page about Show Pay. It provides app screenshots, a referral link, task income examples and a USDT-to-INR estimate calculator.</p>
      <h2>Separate from the platform</h2>
      <p>This website does not operate Show Pay, hold funds, process payments, register accounts or manage orders. It does not claim to be a bank or the official payment platform. The Show Pay name and supplied app screenshots identify the service discussed here.</p>
      <h2>Rates, task income and bonus</h2>
      <p>The displayed USDT rate is configured for this promotional page. It is not a live exchange quote. Estimates exclude fees and other deductions. The platform’s current rate, eligibility rules and order details determine what is actually available.</p>
      <p>The supplied task screenshot shows ₹3.60 income on a ₹100 task, corresponding to 3.6%. The 2% bonus or reward ratio is shown separately. The calculator and table do not combine them. These are arithmetic examples before fees, not guarantees of eligibility, payment or withdrawal completion. Confirm current terms in the app.</p>
      <h2>Registration and downloads</h2>
      <p>App-access buttons lead to app-web.showpayweb.com using invite code 1eashowpb2dp. The download button opens the destination page; this website does not host, verify or install an APK. Follow the destination’s current instructions and review what you are downloading.</p>
      <h2>Referral disclosure</h2>
      <p>The link includes a referral code. The person associated with that code may be eligible for benefits under the platform’s referral rules. This site does not determine those rules or guarantee a benefit.</p>
      <h2>Screenshots and support</h2>
      <p>Screenshots are interface examples and may differ from the live app. Figures in a screenshot are not a promise about your account. For account, task or payment questions, use Contact Us or the help options within the platform. The Telegram channel linked from this guide is supplied by the website owner; it is not independently verified as official platform support.</p>
